SUMMARY:West 94 Street Pub: Pumpkin Carving 🎃
DESCRIPTION:Discover Durham Together\nHere's a little bit about the pub: *
 **The Pub was opened by Miss Sarah in 1994. She was a determined woman who
  wanted to open a “Cheers” like Pub that women would feel safe coming 
 to alone. Over the years\, she not only provided a “safe place”\, but 
 she also created a second home to many in the community. A place where cus
 tomers could create new friendships\, to come during good and bad times\, 
 and for some to meet their soulmate. Her daughter\, Kerry came to assist h
 er in 1999 and has kept the Pub in business since the passing of her mothe
 r\, Miss Sarah in November 2023.***\n\nThe actual contest info 🎃:\n**Th
 e Pub will provide the pumpkins and carving tools. Participants can team u
 p together (2ppl per team) and must sign up to participate\, by calling 91
 9-403-0025. Prizes awarded for 1st\, 2nd\, & 3rd place team winners.**\n\n
 Or come just carve some pumpkins\, I know I'll be doing that anyways.\n\nP
 lenty of parking in the parking lot! Hope to see you there
